flowchart TD
    Start([User Initiates Produce Appraisal]) --> Obs1[Capture Observation k=1]
    Obs1 --> EstQual[Model-Agnostic Quality Estimation]
    EstQual --> CalcUncQual[Compute Epistemic Quality Uncertainty U_quality]
    
    CalcUncQual --> IngestMkt[Ingest Multi-Source Market Records]
    IngestMkt --> ScoreRel[Score Source Reliability Recency, Geo, Authority]
    ScoreRel --> EstMkt[Weighted Price Estimation & Market Variance U_market]
    
    EstMkt --> ValEngine[Propagate Compound Valuation Variance sigma_fair^2]
    ValEngine --> FairRange[Derive Quality-Adjusted Fair Range [Min, Max]]
    
    FairRange --> Controller{Adaptive Controller<br/>Evaluate EVI vs Cost}
    
    Controller -->|EVI > Cost AND k < MaxObs| ReqObs[Formulate Targeted Observation Request<br/>'Capture opposite side / damaged area']
    ReqObs --> UserPrompt[Prompt User in UI with Guidance & Justification]
    UserPrompt --> NewObs[Acquire Observation k = k + 1]
    NewObs --> FuseObs[Multi-Observation Fusion Engine<br/>Defect Preservation & Variance Reduction]
    FuseObs --> CalcUncQual
    
    Controller -->|EVI <= Cost OR k >= MaxObs OR Confident| Finalize([Finalize Valuation])
    Finalize --> AnomalyCheck[Price-Quality Anomaly Detector]
    AnomalyCheck -->|Uncertainty High| Guard[Output INSUFFICIENT_CONFIDENCE<br/>Advise cautious inspection]
    AnomalyCheck -->|Uncertainty Normal| Assert[Output Confident Verdict<br/>OVERPRICED / FAIR / GOOD_DEAL]
    Guard --> HaggleEngine[Confidence-Aware Negotiation Strategy]
    Assert --> HaggleEngine
